{"file": "C:/Users/Garrett/Sports/docs/arxiv-program/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/1675-regime-dependent-factor-glasso.md", "equation": "Method — FGL:** model forecast errors e_t = B f_t + ε_t (approximate factor model, PCA estimation); impose Graphical-LASSO sparsity only on the *idiosyncratic* precision Θ_ε; reassemble Θ = Θ_ε − Θ_ε B[Θ_f + B'Θ_ε B]⁻¹B'Θ_ε via Sherman–Morrison–Woodbury (eq. 3.2); weights ŵ = Θ̂ι/(ι'Θ̂ι).", "page_or_eqnum": null, "wave": 9136}
