{"file": "C:/Users/Garrett/Sports/docs/arxiv-program/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/1720-sportr-benchmark-multimodal-llm-reasoning.md", "equation": "Model training (proof of concept): Qwen-2.5VL-7B, two stages — (1) SFT on the SportsImage CoT data, (2) GRPO reinforcement learning. GRPO objective: J_GRPO(θ) = E[min(ρ_i A_i, clip(ρ_i, 1−ε, 1+ε) A_i) − β·D_KL(π_θ(· | q))], with advantage A_i = (r_i − μ_r)/σ_r over grouped rollouts. Reward: R(o | q) = 1.0·R_correct + 0.5·R_format (correctness + output-format adherence). Trained on 4×H20 GPUs, image data only.", "page_or_eqnum": null, "wave": 9136}
