{"file": "C:/Users/Garrett/Sports/docs/arxiv-program/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/1744-kellyboost-growth-optimal-portfolio-construction.md", "equation": "Loss (Eq. 1): ℓ_t = −log(1+S_t), S_t = w_t^T y_t; (1/n)Σ_t ℓ_t = −Ê[log(1+S)]. Population proposition: any minimizer of E[−log(1+σ(z(x))^T y)] satisfies σ(z(x)) ∈ argmax_{w} E[log(1+w^T y) | x] a.e. — the conditional Kelly portfolio on the simplex.", "page_or_eqnum": null, "wave": 9136}
